      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰的年轻热血正在寻求斗争。\n虽然也可以用一句\n“不要强人所难”敷衍过去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5ddedaa36cee73cd78425dac9398e1a30fac5d9a66805c520e1fff86b6634c6",
